.TH SPPDOCS_BUILD 1 "September 2026" "SPP CLI Manual" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sppdocs:build \- Compile SPPDocs documentation into standalone static HTML/CSS/JS for edge CDN hosting
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php sppdocs:build
[\fB\-\-project\fR=\fIproject_id\fR]
[\fB\-\-out\fR=\fIoutput_path\fR]
[\fB\-\-zip\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBsppdocs:build\fR is an enterprise static site generator (SSG) command that compiles dynamic SPPDocs projects into fully pre-rendered, standalone static web bundles.
.PP
The resulting output can be hosted on edge CDNs (such as Cloudflare Pages, Vercel, GitHub Pages, or Amazon S3) with sub-20ms Time To First Byte (TTFB), eliminating PHP-FPM server runtime overhead and database locking constraints.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-project\fR=\fIproject_id\fR
Specify the identifier of the documentation project to compile. Defaults to \fBdemo-app\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR=\fIoutput_path\fR
Override the destination directory. Defaults to \fBsrc/SPPDocs/dist/<projectId>/\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-zip\fR
Package the generated static directory into a deployable \fB.zip\fR archive.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
.IP \(bu 3
Reads configuration from \fBsrc/SPPDocs/etc/sppdocs.yml\fR and project YAML declarations.
.IP \(bu 3
Parses Markdown frontmatter and translates CommonMark syntax, GitHub alerts, and Blade component tags into static HTML.
.IP \(bu 3
Copies local stylesheets from \fBsrc/SPPDocs/resources/css/\fR into \fB./assets/\fR.
.IP \(bu 3
Generates an inverted-index \fBsearch-index.json\fR for zero-latency client-side search.
.IP \(bu 3
Requires CLI SAPI execution (\fBisCLIOnly() = true\fR).
